## Step

Resolved when the approved Effect Schemas own observation, reflection, evidence, cursor, migration, persistence, and search-result boundaries; accepted Run deltas project idempotently after Stop; SessionEnd finalizes trailing work; project-scoped reflection preserves evidence edges; and failures emit health receipts without corrupting the last valid projection. This build work is authorized by [Redefine Session Search as an Effect Schema Observational Projection](./redefine-session-search-effect-schema.svx) only after the prototype blocker closes.
